tasks.description:
创建 Note 模型用于存储笔记数据。在 app/models/ 目录下创建 note.py 文件，定义字段: id (唯一标识), content (笔记内容), created_at (创建时间)。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {content: str}) -> {id, content, created_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, content, created_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, content, created_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {content: str}) -> {id, content, created_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

实现笔记的 CRUD API 路由。在 app/routes/ 目录下创建 notes.py 文件，定义增删改查接口，连接数据库模型。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {content: str}) -> {id, content, created_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, content, created_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, content, created_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {content: str}) -> {id, content, created_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

设计笔记管理的前端页面。在 templates/ 目录下创建 notes.html 文件，包含笔记创建表单、笔记列表展示区域，以及搜索功能。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {content: str}) -> {id, content, created_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, content, created_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, content, created_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {content: str}) -> {id, content, created_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

添加笔记分类和标签功能。在 app/models/ 目录下扩展 note.py 文件，增加 category 和 tags 字段；更新 API 路由支持分类和标签的增删改查。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {content: str, category: str, tags: [str]}) -> {id, content, category, tags, created_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, content, category, tags, created_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, content, category, tags, created_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {content: str, category: str, tags: [str]}) -> {id, content, category, tags, created_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

在后端实现搜索功能，支持按内容、分类和标签搜索。在 app/routes/notes.py 文件中添加搜索接口；更新前端页面支持搜索表单。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {content: str, category: str, tags: [str]}) -> {id, content, category, tags, created_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, content, category, tags, created_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, content, category, tags, created_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {content: str, category: str, tags: [str]}) -> {id, content, category, tags, created_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}
- GET /notes/search (request: {query: str}) -> [{id, content, category, tags, created_at}]
